<ul>
<li>On joining from an invite you&#8217;re told how clips you don&#8217;t have will arrive &#8212; streamed as review copies, downloaded from links your host set, or as a package (Download and Open in Review &#9656; Share This Review). A clip that can&#8217;t be found says exactly what would fix it.</li>
</ul>
